It consists of a series of five subdivides:
(a) Dongting Chongyang Temple complex, with main storey, domed and ornately carved tower towers;
(b) Tianhe temple complex, with lotus statues and Chinese stone pillars;
(c) Xioyang-Yuin Temple complex, with other temples;
(d) Changzhi Temple complex, with a huge stone column and decorative columns around the central square.
